  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-consorts-kaozheng-wyd:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">武穆裴皇后傳吳郡<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-consorts-kaozheng-wyd:p002:m0008" ref="8k5_lxv_2s6">韓蘭英</persName>○汲古閣本蘭下旁注宋本作藺四字</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-consorts-kaozheng-wyd:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">后牀帷陳設故舊釵鑷十餘枚○汲古閣本牀下旁注宋本作宋四字</p>
